    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience just how quickly things can change as an unsuspecting high schooler who suddenly becomes the center of a government program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forced to traverse an unfamiliar world, you'll need to utilize your closest friendships and all of your willpower if you wish to leave in one piece.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you handle the pressure, or will you unravel at the seams? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXODUS: Sunflower on the Horizon is a deeply compelling, original anime-style RPG. The game is reminiscent of both visual novels and RPGs- Taking with it only the best of what both experiences offer, and combining to create a unique and inventive take on a classic genre.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience just how quickly things can change as an unsuspecting high schooler who suddenly becomes the center of a government program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forced to traverse an unfamiliar world, you'll need to utilize your closest friendships and all of your willpower if you wish to leave in one piece.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you handle the pressure, or will you unravel at the seams? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXODUS: Sunflower on the Horizon is a deeply compelling, original anime-style RPG. The game is reminiscent of both visual novels and RPGs- Taking with it only the best of what both experiences offer, and combining to create a unique and inventive take on a classic genre.</p>",
    "short_description": "You're given a chance to find out what really makes the earth turn... But will you like what you see? EXODUS is the ultimate sci-fi RPG about love, friendship, and deadly monsters.",
